    "detailed_description": "<strong>Description:</strong><br><br>Step into the gritty, unforgiving world of &quot;Gangbanged by Orcs and Goblins!&quot; A visually stunning visual novel that immerses you in a post-apocalyptic wasteland, where survival is a constant struggle against ruthless foes and harsh conditions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961650/extras/7c34685ea6bdd1fc2886bf503e743709.avif?t=1717653994\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br>In this narrative-driven adventure, you take on the role of Alyssa, one of the few remaining survivors in a world overrun by marauding goblins and orcs. Your journey will test not only your physical prowess but also your moral compass as you navigate through a world where the line between right and wrong is blurred.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961650/extras/71ea722be79b4cb6ab8a91ed20bfb070.avif?t=1717653994\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br>Forge alliances, make difficult choices, and fight tooth and nail to protect what little you have left. But be warned, danger lurks around every corner, and the path to survival is fraught with peril.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961650/extras/581757a64272cfa676f2335578265e0e.avif?t=1717653994\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br>Prepare to be swept away by a tale of courage, sacrifice, and the indomitable human spirit. Will you emerge victorious, or will you succumb to the merciless forces that seek to destroy you?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961650/extras/7d07f386a01f0ee5a285f4612186804a.avif?t=1717653994\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Stunning HD renders bring the post-apocalyptic world to vivid life, with breathtaking attention to detail.<br></li><li>Immerse yourself in an intricate storyline filled with twists, turns, and morally ambiguous decisions that shape the outcome of your journey.<br></li><li>Explore a diverse cast of characters, each with their own motivations and agendas, as you navigate through a world on the brink of collapse.<br></li><li>Experience intense, explicit scenes that add depth and realism to the narrative, pushing the boundaries of storytelling in the visual novel genre.<br></li><li>Enjoy the convenience of single-handed gameplay, allowing you to immerse yourself fully in the experience without any distractions.</li></ul>",
